  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"743\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"743\">Clinical Use / Interpretation:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"1051\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"924\">\n<p data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"789\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"775\">Elevated Copper in Urine</strong> may indicate:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"924\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"814\">\n<p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"814\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"814\">Wilson&rsquo;s disease</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"838\">\n<p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"838\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"838\">Copper toxicity</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"868\">\n<p data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"868\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"868\">Chronic liver disease</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"924\">\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"924\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Excessive copper exposure (occupational or dietary)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"1051\">\n<p data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"957\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">This test may be followed by:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1051\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1005\">\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1005\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"988\">24-hour urinary copper</strong> for confirmation</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1051\">\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1051\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1051\">Serum ceruloplasmin and copper levels</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
